---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Ducky's MTG Corner"
  description="Explore Ducky's Magic: The Gathering card hunt, favorite artwork, and journey replacing proxies with collected cards."
>
  <section aria-labelledby="mtg-heading" class="mtg-hero px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <a
        href="/#about"
        class="rounded-sm font-semibold text-pyroduck-plasma transition-colors hover:text-pyroduck-lime focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        ← Back to About me
      </a>

      <p
        class="mb-3 mt-10 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        Beyond the code
      </p>

      <h1
        id="mtg-heading"
        class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-text sm:text-6xl"
      >
        Ducky's <span class="text-pyroduck-plasma">MTG Corner.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
        A little space for Magic: The Gathering—building decks, enjoying the
        artwork, and gradually replacing my proxies with cards I want to own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="card-hunt"
    aria-labelledby="hunt-heading"
    class="scroll-mt-32 px-6 pb-16 sm:pb-24"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <p
        class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-pyroduck-lime"
      >
        On the lookout
      </p>

      <h2
        id="hunt-heading"
        class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text sm:text-4xl"
      >
        The card hunt.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
        The cards, artwork, and finishes I'm looking for as I build my
        collection, one card at a time.
      </p>

      <div
        class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-pyroduck-plasma/30 bg-pyroduck-afterdark p-6 sm:p-8"
      >
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
          My first hunt is coming together.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-brand-muted">
          Check back for the cards I'm searching for and the versions I have my
          eye on.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .mtg-hero {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse at 85% 50%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pyroduck-plasma) 14%, transparent),
      transparent 65%
    );
  }

  .mtg-hero::before,
  .mtg-hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    top: 18%;
    right: 8%;
    width: clamp(160px, 20vw, 260px);
    aspect-ratio: 5 / 7;
    border: 1px solid
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pyroduck-plasma) 25%, transparent);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pyroduck-plasma) 6%, transparent),
      transparent
    );
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: rotate(14deg);
  }

  .mtg-hero::after {
    right: 13%;
    top: 23%;
    transform: rotate(-10deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .mtg-hero::before,
    .mtg-hero::after {
      opacity: 0.4;
      right: -3rem;
    }

    .mtg-hero::after {
      right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
